OL,3,ARussia struck train near Poland border
OL,4,Ashortly after Boris Johnson and top
OL,5,AEuropean officials passed through
OL,6,
OL,7,FA Russian drone has hit a train near
OL,8,Fthe Ukraine-Poland border shortly after
OL,9,Fformer UK Prime Minister Boris Johnson
OL,10,Fand top European security officials had
OL,11,Fpassed through.
OL,13,FNo casualties were reported after the
OL,14,FRussian strike at Yahodyn, which hit
OL,15,Fthe train's engine. All the passengers
OL,16,Fhad been evacuated, Ukrainian
OL,17,Fauthorities said. Russia said it struck
OL,18,F"railway infrastructure" in western
OL,19,FUkraine.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
