OL,3,ARussia struck train near Poland border
OL,4,Ashortly after Boris Johnson and top
OL,5,AEuropean officials passed through
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohnson and some of Europe's most
OL,8,Fsenior security advisers, including the
OL,9,FUK's Jonathan Powell, had passed along
OL,10,Fthe same line on their way back from a
OL,11,Fconference in the capital, Kyiv.
OL,13,FThe former PM said "I don't know what
OL,14,Fwarped logic drove Putin to blow up a
OL,15,Fstationary Ukrainian locomotive on the
OL,16,FPolish border this morning" and asked
OL,17,F"When are we going to give them the air
OL,18,Fdefences they need?"
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
